* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产：一旦被当作文本做行尾规范化，字节就会坏
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.vsix binary
*.onnx binary

# 补丁必须逐字节交给 git apply：CRLF 会让 apply --3way 上下文匹配失败
*.patch text eol=lf